      "html": "<div class=\"ds-card\"><div class=\"ds-card-title\">Sources</div><div class=\"ds-card-desc\">Pages used as evidence for this research.</div><a class=\"ds-src\" href=\"#\">news.example/brightline-second-facility</a></div>",
