      "description": "Signature: tabular score, fit badge, and per-criterion bars in foreground (never verdict hues).",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-card ds-score\"><div class=\"ds-card-title\">ICP Score</div><div class=\"ds-score-head\"><span class=\"ds-score-num\">95</span><span class=\"ds-score-of\">/ 100</span><span class=\"ds-badge ds-high\"><i></i>High Fit</span></div><div class=\"ds-crit\"><div class=\"ds-crit-row\"><b>Industry Fit</b><span>30 / 35</span></div><div class=\"ds-bar\"><div style=\"width:86%\"></div></div><p>Met · Target vertical: Manufacturing</p></div><div class=\"ds-crit\"><div class=\"ds-crit-row\"><b>Company Size</b><span>— / 15</span></div><div class=\"ds-bar\"><div style=\"width:0\"></div></div><p><em>Unknown</em> · Employee count not found</p></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-card{padding:20px;border-radius:calc(var(--radius,0.625rem)*1.4);border:1px solid var(--border,oklch(0.92 0.004 286.32));background:var(--card,#fff);color:var(--card-foreground,oklch(0.21 0.006 285.885));font-family:'Geist Variable',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-score{width:320px}.ds-card-title{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.025em}.ds-score-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;margin:20px 0 16px}.ds-score-num{font-size:36px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;line-height:1.1}.ds-score-of{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted-foreground,oklch(0.552 0.016 285.938))}.ds-badge{margin-left:auto;align-self:center;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:9999px;border:1px solid var(--success-border,oklch(0.905 0.093 164.15));background:var(--success-soft,oklch(0.979 0.021 166.113));color:var(--success-foreground,oklch(0.432 0.095 166.913));font-size:12px;font-weight:500}.ds-badge i{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--success,oklch(0.596 0.145 163.225))}.ds-crit{font-size:14px;margin-top:12px}.ds-crit-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.ds-crit-row b{font-weight:500}.ds-crit-row span{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--muted-foreground,oklch(0.552 0.016 285.938))}.ds-bar{margin-top:4px;height:6px;border-radius:9999px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--muted,oklch(0.967 0.001 286.375))}.ds-bar div{height:100%;border-radius:9999px;background:color-mix(in oklch,var(--foreground,oklch(0.21 0.006 285.885)) 80%,transparent)}.ds-crit p{margin:4px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted-foreground,oklch(0.552 0.016 285.938))}"
